<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">我们的餐桌</view><view class="title"><text>好好吃饭，
也好好相聚。</text></view><view wx:if="{{!me}}"><view class="muted">登录后，记录每一次一起做饭的日常。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="signIn">微信登录</button><view class="notice">登录用于记录点餐与评价身份。首次登录自动创建账号，昵称可稍后修改。</view></view><block wx:else><view class="section"><view class="subtitle">{{me.user.nickname}}</view><view class="muted"><text class="dot"/>{{me.chefRestaurantId ? '家庭主厨' : (me.dailyAllowed ? '日常访问已开启' : '已登录')}}</view></view><view class="section"><view>个人昵称</view><input class="input" type="nickname" value="{{nickname}}" maxlength="200" bindinput="input" placeholder="怎么称呼你"/><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存昵称</button></view><view class="row section" bindtap="parties"><text>我参加的聚会</text><text class="muted">当前 / 历史 ›</text></view><view class="row section" bindtap="reviews"><text>评价与邀请</text><text class="muted">待评价 / 我发表的 ›</text></view><view class="row section" bindtap="access"><text>日常密令</text><text class="muted">{{me.dailyAllowed ? '查看访问资格' : '输入密令'}} ›</text></view><view class="row section" wx:if="{{me.chefRestaurantId}}" bindtap="chef"><text>主厨工作台</text><text class="muted">管理我的餐厅 ›</text></view><view class="link" bindtap="logout">退出登录</view></block><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view></view>
